{"version":1,"key":"card:427","content":{"id":427,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a13f444-9651-479b-8af5-256bbec2176e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然意识到读书要思考，但是读到难处，即使不是很清楚，也不会停下来思考清楚再往下，大概率有个印象，就接着往下读了，这种不求甚解的读法，虽然读的很快，但是读完后问我一些问题，我却答不上来！"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6d046a71-0f8d-40c4-b722-6e7b2e47a0c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我的阅读习惯往往是先快速读完一遍，然后在细读不懂之处，当然这是理想的方式，如果按照这种方式来，我想效果也不会比读读停停的差，但往往读完一本书之后，有几个原因让我不读第二遍："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"89c5893f-8252-4709-b5fa-77688cde8d22","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"57f45ebc-85a5-4f20-a1ee-74efbbc121f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41e9b7bf-6dd4-42cc-9a5a-5f1b4264b1f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我还有很多书要读，去读另一本了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e27b602f-d8ac-4f2e-adc2-e8a1167d2b4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41549195-d276-4329-9f84-4d8fcfc91d75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"读完之后就仿佛完成一个任务，这个事情就到此为止了"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6644b3f-3a63-4952-af66-74593b3508a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以再读一遍的想法不可行，再读一遍很有可能是我自己给自己找的一个借口，只是为了早点把书读完，把目标达成，正确的目标应该是把书读透，是读懂而不是读完。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5714c9f5-1903-4ef4-8de9-0ac4a2283289","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于专业书籍的阅读，这种不求甚解的读法坏处大于好处，精读一本书的成就感是泛泛而读无法带来的，我想读书时有必要给我下一个指标，这本必须要读多少个小时，必须做多少篇笔记，迫使我放慢节奏，去思考，这样才能把书读透。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3940daaf-a3c7-4bb1-ab46-97c70997ac10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当然这种读法只限于读专业书，对于一些文学书、科普书，非我专业，我想咱也不必深究，只是在脑子中埋下一颗种子，培养一点情操，这就足够了，对于这类书，不求甚解的读法更适合。"}]}],"tags":["思考/学习方法"],"createTime":1714637819395,"updateTime":1755510222130,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755510222130}}